 long as we were able to provide availability and linearizability at the same time (that is, to the extent that the tester can test). The exception was partitioning and replication, which should be done exactly the way Dynamo does.","topics":[],"score":212365,"global_rank":262586},{"name":"Venkteshkavi/Algorithms-DataStructures-Efficient-Practices","owner":"Venkteshkavi","html_url":"https://github.com/Venkteshkavi/Algorithms-DataStructures-Efficient-Practices","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Java","description":"This repository contains some interesting leetcode and programming problems","topics":[],"score":212365,"global_rank":262587},{"name":"noohgnus/Fitbit_JHProHealth_Android","owner":"noohgnus","html_url":"https://github.com/noohgnus/Fitbit_JHProHealth_Android","stars":0,"forks":1,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Java","description":null,"topics":[],"score":212364,"global_rank":262597},{"name":"eddie-wang/LeetCode","owner":"eddie-wang","html_url":"https://github.com/eddie-wang/LeetCode","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Java","description":"My answers for problems on LeetCode","topics":[],"score":212360,"global_rank":262600},{"name":"matthewstulz/DataStructuresAndAlgorithmsImplementations","owner":"matthewstulz","html_url":"https://github.com/matthewstulz/DataStructuresAndAlgorithmsImplementations","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Java","description":"My implementations of common Data Structures and Algoithms.","topics":["algorithms","datastructures","datastructures-algorithms","java"],"score":212351,"global_rank":262646},{"name":"prasanth50/fundamental","owner":"prasanth50","html_url":"https://github.com/prasanth50/fundamental","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Java","description":null,"topics":[],"score":212351,"global_rank":262651},{"name":"prasanth50/fundamentals-","owner":"prasanth50","html_url":"https://github.com/prasanth50/fundamentals-","stars":0,"forks":0,"wa